			dependencies: ["14F8810FFFD16F9C", "389ED54791286682"]
			description: ["The &6MAX Energy Input Hatch&r, its &616 A&r version, the &6MAX Input Bus&r and the &6MAX Battery&r are built on the MAX hull. With them in place the OpV pair you have been using can retire; the big rows at Sgr A* run on two 16 A hatches."]
