		{
			dependencies: ["764F18E0B5749AFE"]
			description: ["The &6Horizon Interferometer&r reads the light that the closed shell returns and maps the cloud of phases around the hole. Its second mode calibrates oscillators against that map. A closed shell that has run its first recipe, and the casings and parts new to this machine. The cloud phase map and the calibrated oscillator bank of the last recipe. Maps and banks leave by bus; keep the oscillators on their own line."]
			icon: "gtceu:horizon_interferometer"
