		}
		{
			dependencies: ["75EEF916B1DD0828"]
			description: ["The &6Cloud Phase Map&r holds the phase of the light at every point of the shell. The &6Calibrated Oscillator Bank&r keeps a clock against it. The last recipe wants both."]
