		}
		{
			dependencies: ["348A116DE7098B29"]
			description: ["The &6Geroch Winch&r lowers a tether over the horizon and takes power from the spin of the hole. It wears its tether as it works. A formed winch at the black hole orbit and a stock of tethers. The first MAX power that is not a fuel. Spare tethers arrive over AE2; a worn one goes back to its line."]
			icon: "gtceu:geroch_winch"
			id: "51FFBC5A2B05B2CA"
