		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7AEEF7B6A57C9C2F"]
			description: ["Once the &6Mirror Shell&r is up it has a power mode of its own, the vent, which lets back out part of the light the shell returned to the hole. A closed shell and a seed wave packet to start it. Power drawn from the shell instead of fuel, for as long as the packet lasts. Packets arrive by bus; watch the network at the start of each one."]
			icon: "gtceu:mirror_shell"
			id: "766DF39BA6B1F04B"
