		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["The &6Accretion Disk Skimmer&r, &6Plasma Mass Filter&r, &6FRC Former&r and &6BZ Dynamo&r each take a mode that works on matter from the disc: hot flow, filtered flow, flux-loaded plasma and a dynamo fed by it. The UXV controllers you already own, and the hot flow from the black hole orbit. The fuels and feeds of the machines of the era. Flow by pipe from the orbit; send filtered cuts to their own lines."]
			icon: "gtceu:accretion_disk_skimmer"
