		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["The &6Droplet Radiator Works&r and &6Femtosecond Writer&r each take a MAX mode: nozzle plates for the shell radiator, and writes on the new die. The UIV controllers you already own. The shell radiator and the MAX die. Plates by bus; return what the writer rejects."]
