		{
			dependencies: ["5FD613EAED3F564B"]
			description: ["The &6Megabar Press&r and &6Degenerate Harvester&r each take a MAX row: the press shapes the heavy plates of the shell and the harvester gathers degenerate matter for the engine's slug. The UEV controllers you already own and matter from the orbit. The plates of the shell and the slug of the Penrose payload. Matter and plates by bus. The spent slug is an output, so route it."]
