		{
			dependencies: ["305F48FF31D86B06"]
			description: ["The &6Extraction Cascade&r takes a row that sorts belt rock into its metals before the furnace takes it. The EV controller you already own and rock from the belt. The metal feedstock of the segments. Rock in by bus; each metal leaves on its own line."]
			icon: "gtceu:extraction_cascade"
