		{
			dependencies: ["187F0BA64323CC4D", "373D406AA533F310"]
			description: ["A library of every genome the pack has met, written to crystal in a sealed cold vault. The &6Gene Ark&r makes the genome archive that goes into the last seed. The MAX hull, a sterilising filter casing vault with a cryogenic core, a Rydberg logic array and a superconducting membrane. The genome archive, which the later gates and MAX+ count on. Genomes arrive by ME; one archive is enough, so cap it."]
			icon: "gtceu:gene_ark"
			id: "77428218C6DD16A7"
