		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["It shapes hot flow into streams, and the streams into bundles. The &6Mass Stream Injector&r holds a shell up with moving mass. The MAX hull, a ring of stream-turn casing round a pellet accelerator, and a matter-wave gradiometer from the atom works at home. The stream bundle, which the mirror shell is built round. Pellets by ME; bundles come out in a chest and go straight to the shell."]
			icon: "gtceu:mass_stream_injector"
